@startuml
title Knock Knock - samtale for én klient

[*] --> WaitingForWhosThere : klient forbinder /\nserver: "Knock! Knock!"

WaitingForWhosThere --> WaitingForWho : "Who's there?" /\nserver: <Who>
WaitingForWhosThere --> WaitingForWhosThere : forkert svar /\n"You are supposed to say: Who's there?"

WaitingForWho --> Finished : "<Who> who?" /\nserver: <Punchline> Want another joke? (y/n)
WaitingForWho --> WaitingForWho : forkert svar /\n"You are supposed to say: <Who> who?"

Finished --> WaitingForWhosThere : "y" / ny joke vælges,\nserver: "Knock! Knock!"
Finished --> Finished : andet svar /\n"Please answer y or n."
Finished --> [*] : "n" / server: "Bye!"

note "Klienten afbryder forbindelsen\n(fra alle tilstande) -> samtalen slutter" as N
@enduml
